# LF everywhere, on every OS: Python, sh and hook scripts read files raw, and packs/vendor/ files are verified
# byte for byte against PROVENANCE.json hashes (CRLF conversion on Windows would break `eos vendor check`).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
